            <p>All data that can support the findings of this study are available in the main text and <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="supplementary material anchor" href="/articles/s41893-026-01934-4#MOESM1">Supplementary Information</a>. <a data-track="click" data-track-label="link" data-track-action="section anchor" href="/articles/s41893-026-01934-4#Sec17">Source data</a> are provided with this paper.</p>
